  "notes": "Cash basis county, aligned with FY2023 choices. Statement lines from Total Governmental Funds column (p5-6). Taxes 3,076,267 split using Statement of Activities p2 (Property 2,847,090, Motor vehicle 189,282, Lodging 39,895; exact); Inheritance tax printed separately. Beginning fund balance as originally stated 2,012,763 with printed prior period adjustment 244,230 (Note 11; Health Insurance Buydown fund) in adjustments; beginning cash not printed. Ending cash = total assets p4 (cash + restricted cash). Sale of surplus 178,549 in other_financing and bond proceeds 271,000 in debt_proceeds (printed under other financing sources). Balance sheet from the governmental funds Statement of Assets and Fund Balances Total column (p4), which equals the government-wide Statement of Net Position (p1). Detail: General Fund budget schedule p10 (General Fund column only; its Local 507,137 includes sale of surplus 23,188); other General Fund sub-funds (Inheritance Tax, Veteran's Aid, Relief, Planning & Zoning, Health Insurance Buydown) from the combining page p7-8; Road, Building/Plumbing Shop Bond and COVID American Rescue Plan budget schedules p11-13 (Road single disbursements line split per statement Road column p5; COVID disbursements categorized from p6); non-major funds per fund from combining p9 (Drug Law Enforcement Fund had no activity). Read pages 1-13 of 13"
}
